{"words": [{"text": "وَإِنْ", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "خِفْتُمْ", "translation": "you fear"}, {"text": "شِقَاقَ", "translation": "a dissension"}, {"text": "بَيْنِهِمَا", "translation": "between (the) two of them"}, {"text": "فَٱبْعَثُوا۟", "translation": "then send"}, {"text": "حَكَمًۭا", "translation": "an arbitrator"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "أَهْلِهِۦ", "translation": "his family"}, {"text": "وَحَكَمًۭا", "translation": "and an arbitrator"}, {"text": "مِّنْ", "translation": "from"}, {"text": "أَهْلِهَآ", "translation": "her family"}, {"text": "إِن", "translation": "If"}, {"text": "يُرِيدَآ", "translation": "they both wish"}, {"text": "إِصْلَـٰحًۭا", "translation": "reconciliation"}, {"text": "يُوَفِّقِ", "translation": "will cause reconciliation"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهُ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "بَيْنَهُمَآ ۗ", "translation": "between both of them"}, {"text": "إِنَّ", "translation": "Indeed"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "عَلِيمًا", "translation": "All-Knower"}, {"text": "خَبِيرًۭا", "translation": "All-Aware"}], "sahih": "And if you fear dissension between the two, send an arbitrator from his people and an arbitrator from her people. If they both desire reconciliation, Allāh will cause it between them. Indeed, Allāh is ever Knowing and Aware."}